{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a heartwarming puzzle experience in <strong>Cat Snap</strong>!<br>Guide an adorable, free-roaming kitty and capture the perfect shot at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 levels included in the full version of <i>Cat Snap</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 5\u201315 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data cannot be transferred to the full version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note:</i><br>As this is a demo, updates may be applied without prior notice.<br>Save data from previous versions may not be compatible after updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play and Snap in Various Scenarios</strong><br>Interact with your cat in different situations, move them around, and take beautiful, memorable photos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Cat Movements in Every Level</strong><br>Each stage features a kitty with its own movement patterns and playful behaviors\u2014experiment to find the best way to capture them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 5\u201310 minutes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952560?t=1755590334","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952560/d1d978be9db6d6b833a2b90b981e092523f16f58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755590334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952560/600a0262bd04366edcc8e0fceab709a45a59c1d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755590334","capsule_image